{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（大表哥，Stanley）和李炘頤（Alina）在峇里舉行婚禮，部分鏡仔成員包括盧瀚霆（Anson Lo）﹑呂爵安﹑李駿傑﹑姜濤﹑邱傲然和柳應廷飛當地見證喜事。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:43.273685+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:23:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:06.093740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:01.172932+00:00","content_hash":"98b248005b57939198a4a6ceb6ed164d8a9bdea76a7620986cc08ab3e14b7d4a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}